23:42.920 --> 23:43.920
Hamba tak berani.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.920
Hamba dengar bahawa

23:46.350 --> 23:48.240
Isteri Bangsawan Pengasas Negara
dah berjanji,

23:48.240 --> 23:50.960
