24:46.720 --> 24:48.830
Bagus!

24:49.000 --> 24:50.400
Bola pasukan biru masuk!

24:50.710 --> 24:52.520
[Pasukan Merah: 1]
[Pasukan Biru: 1]

24:54.350 --> 24:55.400
Sangat seronok.

25:00.750 --> 25:01.590
Qingru

25:01.590 --> 25:02.480
