25:38.680 --> 25:39.720
Malu betul.

25:41.270 --> 25:43.030
Abang Chunzhi, saya tak nak main dah!

25:43.030 --> 25:43.590
Tiada apa-apa.

25:43.590 --> 25:44.350
Macam inilah,

25:44.350 --> 25:45.200
