26:17.880 --> 26:18.550
Itu saja.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.350
Boleh tak?

26:21.200 --> 26:21.930
Cuba sekali.

26:35.550 --> 26:37.120
Bagus!

26:37.140 --> 26:38.540
Bola pasukan biru masuk!

26:38.790 --> 26:39.550
Bagus!

26:46.100 --> 26:47.420
[Pasukan Merah: 1]
[Pasukan Biru: 2]

26:50.550 --> 26:51.010
Qingru,

26:51.310 --> 26:52.310
awak tengok saya.

26:52.720 --> 26:54.350
Tengok saya kalahkan dia.

26:54.960 --> 26:55.760
Mesti menang!

26:56.720 --> 26:57.480
Sedia.

27:05.640 --> 27:06.070
Pergi!

27:08.590 --> 27:09.920
Abang Chunzhi sangat hebat!

27:09.920 --> 27:11.380
Bola pasukan merah masuk!

27:16.660 --> 27:18.320
[Pasukan Merah: 2]
[Pasukan Biru: 2]

27:43.160 --> 27:44.960
Mak kurang sihat.

27:45.590 --> 27:47.790
Kalau awak menang
dalam pertandingan Chuiwan,

27:47.790 --> 27:50.720
