28:28.350 --> 28:28.880
Marilah.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.270
Seri!

29:00.720 --> 29:02.180
Waktu rehat separuh masa!

29:03.920 --> 29:04.650
Tak apa-apa,

29:04.790 --> 29:06.590
